// memoization — and it's called ~15+ times per fighter per render
// (syncSkillTraitStatBonuses once, fighterNormalProfile a couple of times,
// armorSave once, and statConditionalBadgeMarkup once per stat cell, 13
// times, since every cell calls fighterDetectedConditionalBonusesForStat
// which calls this fresh). Across a roster of several fighters that's a
// large, easily-avoided chunk of the per-click lag on top of the
// activeRoster() fix above. Nothing about a fighter's skills/spells/rules
